#Command Briefing

#Briefing
$start_briefing
$num_stages: 4
$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("This is the $f CRV $f Observer$|, one of our reconnaissance ships in this region of the Galaxy.  She was scheduled to return from the $b Mozzurat $b System after assisting a $y nonaligned $y Weequay underground movement against the Empire.

We have received news that the $f Observer has dropped out of hyperspace due to an uncharted asteroid field ahead of it.", -1)
$end_multi_text
$voice: none.wav
