$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("Red Squadron will be deployed to defend the corvette.  Your mission is to make sure she returns to base intact.  Destroy any asteroid that is on a collision course with the $f Observer$|.  As soon as she enters hyperspace, head home.", -1)
$end_multi_text
