#Debriefing_info

$Num stages: 4

$Formula: ( is-goal-true-delay 
   "Escort Observer" 
   0 
)
$Multi text
    XSTR("The Observer has provided us with little valuable information.  The Weequay resistance force aborted their mission and withdrew when the ISD Dominator entered the Mozzurat System.  Excellent job getting her through the field, nonetheless.  Every ship we save increases our fighting ability and inspires our loyal supporters to greater extents.

For an endeavor such as the Rebel Alliance to succeed, we must value every single person or starship that is available to us.  For now, small victories such as today will suffice.", -1)
$end_multi_text
$Voice: none.wav
$Recommendation text:
    XSTR("", -1)
$end_multi_text

$Formula: ( and 
   ( is-destroyed-delay 0 "Observer" ) 
   ( not 
      ( is-disabled-delay 0 "Observer" ) 
   )
)
$Multi text
    XSTR("Your failure to defend the Observer will cost us dearly.  Though the Weequay resistance force aborted their mission and withdrew when the ISD Dominator entered the Mozzurat System, there would have been other opportunities to assist them had the Observer not perished in the asteroid field.  Every ship we save increases our fighting ability and inspires our loyal supporters to greater extents.

For an endeavor such as the Rebel Alliance to succeed, we must value every single person or starship that is available to us.", -1)
$end_multi_text
$Voice: none.wav
$Recommendation text:
    XSTR("Sweep the asteroid field in front of the corvette.  Don't rely on white brackets entirely.  Divert power from shields to guns to make sure you can maintain your rate of fire.  A quad blast at an asteroid is usually enough.", -1)
$end_multi_text

$Formula: ( and 
   ( is-destroyed-delay 0 "Observer" ) 
   ( has-arrived-delay 0 "Imperator" ) 
)
$Multi text
    XSTR("Your failure to defend the Observer will cost us dearly.  Though the Weequay resistance force aborted their mission and withdrew when the ISD Dominator entered the Mozzurat System, there would have been other opportunities to assist them had the Observer not perished in the asteroid field.  Every ship we save increases our fighting ability and inspires our loyal supporters to greater extents.

For an endeavor such as the Rebel Alliance to succeed, we must value every single person or starship available to us.  The Observer's captain ordered you to withdraw to save your lives--there was nothing else you could have done to protect the corvette from the Imperial light cruisers, but a more skillful escort would have prevented the corvette's engines from getting knocked out.", -1)
$end_multi_text
$Voice: none.wav
$Recommendation text:
    XSTR("The Arquitens Cruisers arrive only if the corvette is disabled.

Sweep the asteroid field in front of the corvette.  Don't rely on white brackets entirely.  Divert power from shields to guns to make sure you can maintain your rate of fire.  A quad blast at an asteroid is usually enough.", -1)
$end_multi_text

$Formula: ( is-event-false-delay 
   "Conditions to depart" 
   0 
)
$Multi text
    XSTR("You have left the asteroid field before you were ordered to do so.

The Rebellion needs not only soldiers, but loyal, obedient soldiers.  Every act of disobedience costs us dearly.", -1)
$end_multi_text
$Voice: none.wav
$Recommendation text:
    XSTR("Sweep the asteroid field in front of the corvette.  Don't rely on white brackets entirely.  Divert power from shields to guns to make sure you can maintain your rate of fire.  A quad blast at an asteroid is usually enough.", -1)
$end_multi_text

